    old "I should give Mika some time. Then, we'll have that last training session.\nShe will wait for me at the arena, early in the day."
    new "Debo darle a Mika algo de tiempo. Entonces, tendremos la última sesión de entrenamiento.\n Ella me esperará en la arena, a primera hora del día."

